      "message": "I understand that this is coming from the supplyNetworkDepersonalizationResponse.\n\nSome devices allow an infinite number of retries (security is not in the number of retries, but rather in the length of the CK and the time to process the request) and this is acceptable from point of view of specifications (which don\u0027t mandate a maximum number of attempts).\n\nCan you expand the interface to also add a case for infinite retries? What should the modem return in that case?",
